# path_ops.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Path.combine's five operations on a circle and a square, a rectangle and
# a rounded window, an even-odd star and an ellipse, cubics and a
# quadratic, filled; the operands stroked; Wonderous's cutout as a clip.
# The stock engine combines with Skia's exact PathOps, fl-engine flattens
# the paths to within a fiftieth of a pixel first. What differs is edge
# coverage, a level or a few, and most of it in the stroked outlines, which
# take no operation. Measured 2026-11-21, lavapipe: 0.308% differ, 0.084%
# by more than 32.
differ 0.6
differ_over_32 0.2
